 is on the ground and there is at least one unoccupied square between themself and the attacker</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon conjures a thin slab of stone in an unoccupied square between themself and the attacker. The dragon gains standard @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.other-effects.Item.I9lfZUiCwMiGogVi]{Cover} against the triggering attack. The stone falls on the first person other than the dragon who enters that square, dealing @Damage[6d6[bludgeoning]] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:27|basic] save. Otherwise, it crumbles harmlessly after 1 round.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4es0QXekunI4s2Zx.pvk0PbPMoBskNlw5"},{"_id":"zIZqXSL0hAQdUfuG","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Draconic Frenzy","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon makes two claw Strikes and one tail Strike in any order.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4es0QXekunI4s2Zx.zIZqXSL0hAQdUfuG"},{"_id":"aqSfuozUx5iy9XEQ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Draconic Momentum","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon recharges their Ornamental Breath whenever they score a critical hit with a Strike.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Note","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"strike-attack-roll","text":"{item|description}","title":"{item|name}","visibility":"owner"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4es0QXekunI4s2Zx.aqSfuozUx5iy9XEQ"},{"_id":"MYcCyOG1Mvb6wa41","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Lustrous Lunge","sort":900000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon strikes a pose that makes its hide sparkle in the light. Each creature within @Template[emanation|distance:20]{20 feet} must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|options:area-effect,inflicts:dazzled] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4es0QXekunI4s2Zx.MYcCyOG1Mvb6wa41"},{"_id":"ToxmDcw76iX9uAZO","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Ornamental Breath","sort":1000000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon exhales a torrent of shattered rocks and minerals in a @Template[type:cone|distance:40] dealing @Damage[11d6[piercing]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:30|options:area-effect,inflicts:clumsy] save). A creature who fails the save is weighed down by the stones, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} on a critical failure).</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4es0QXekunI4s2Zx.ToxmDcw76iX9uAZO"}],"name":"Crystal Dragon (Adult)","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":3},"str":{"mod":7},"wis":{"mod":4}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":31},"allSaves":{"value":"+2 status to all saves vs. primal"},"hp":{"details":"","max":190,"temp":0,"value":190},"immunities":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"fascinated"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"paralyzed"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"sleep"}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":150}],"value":40}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["common","draconic","petran","sakvroth"]},"level":{"value":11},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Crystal dragons consider themselves among the more beautiful dragon species and expect others to recognize this. They see little need to accessorize their crystalline hides but might spend hours each day tending to their appearance. They clean themselves frequently, and each scale must be properly faceted and free of imperfections. A crystal dragon may retreat into its lair if its hide gets damaged, manually removing the damaged scales (a painful process!) and then waiting for the replacements to grow in.</p>\n<p>Crystal dragons are also proud of their lairs, which typically contain hoards of gems and crystals. An individual dragon's creative nature shows through in their decor. So do their organizational skills—they can't tolerate a mess. Their habit of constantly updating and rearranging their spaces means visitors might see a fair bit of disarray, however, depending on their timing.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Lost Omens Draconic Codex"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":21,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"acuity":"imprecise","range":60,"type":"scent"},{"acuity":"imprecise","range":60,"type":"tremorsense"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":24},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":18},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":22}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":18},"athletics":{"base":23},"crafting":{"base":20},"diplomacy":{"base":22},"intimidation":{"base":20},"nature":{"base":21},"stealth":{"base":20},"survival":{"base":21},"thievery":{"base":18}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"huge"},"value":["dragon","earth","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.lost-omens-bestiary.Actor.wFcWMrjNtnfSKOYm"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!4es0QXekunI4s2Zx","prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/lost-omens-bestiary/crystal-dragon-adult-lob.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"lost_omens_bestiary__crystal_dragon_adult","sourcePack":"pf2e.lost-omens-bestiary","sourceDocId":"wFcWMrjNtnfSKOYm"}}}